# Get to William Hart
Open the sidemenu
Click the "Control Panel" link
Click the "My Settings" charttab
Select Show from the "E-ChartMeds/AllergiesUnsent Scripts in Alert Bar" dropdown
Click the "Submit Settings" button
Open the sidemenu
Click the E-Chart link
Click the TEST-10019 link
Click the "Medical Record" charttab
Click the Allergies/Medications link
Click the Prescribe link
# Begin prescribing amoxicillin
Enter amoxicil in the qp_acval0 autocomplete
# Type "tablet 500" in the qp_formacval0 autocomplete
# @Wait for select and blur events to finish@driver.sleep(5)
# Close the "Warning for amoxicillin" popup
# Enter "tablet 500" in the qp_formacval0 autocomplete
Click the "tablet 500mg" autocomplete choice
# @Wait for select and blur events to finish@driver.sleep(5)
Close the "Warning for amoxicillin" popup
# Prescribe Keflex instead
Click the 1st "Clear" button
Enter Kefle in the qp_acval0 autocomplete
#Type "capsule 500" in the qp_formacval0 autocomplete
#@Wait for select and blur events to finish@driver.sleep(5)
#Close the "Warning for Keflex" popup
Click the "capsule 500mg" autocomplete choice
#Enter "capsule 500" in the qp_formacval0 autocomplete
Close the "Warning for Keflex" popup
Type "1 bid po" in @id=qp_sig0
@Blur sig@driver.runJS("jQuery('#qp_sig0').blur()")
Type 7d in @id=qp_duration0
@Blur duration@driver.runJS("jQuery('#qp_duration0').blur()")
Type 0 in @id=qp_refills0
Select "Selenium, Selenium" from @id=qp_doctor_id0
Click the 1st "Prescribe" button
Verify exists "Keflex 500 mg capsule" text
Verify exists @Unsent prescriptions alert item@xpath='//span[@id="unsent_span"]/a[contains(text(),"Unsent prescriptions")]'